Commission notice The ‘Blue Guide’ on the implementation of EU product rules 2022 Annex 4</terms:source>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Decision No 768/2008/EC module H1

Conformity based on full quality assurance plus design examination</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">module H1</rdfs:label>
